{"id":"3a26eef9f2574e2f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem.md","title":"Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)","display":"Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem","aliases":["14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem"],"display":"Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>-小且局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为函子。小范畴、局部小性、极限与伴随见所列内部依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl[&amp;\\forall J,H\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\ \\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,H,L,\\pi\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}(G(L),(G(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ H))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(D_i,u_i)_{i\\in I}\\\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ (D_i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land u_i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D_i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D))\\ \\exists i\\in I\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D_i,D)\\ (u=G(h)\\circ u_i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists F\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl[&amp;\\forall J,H\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\ \\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,H,L,\\pi\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}(G(L),(G(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ H))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(D_i,u_i)_{i\\in I}\\\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ (D_i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land u_i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D_i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D))\\ \\exists i\\in I\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D_i,D)\\ (u=G(h)\\circ u_i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists F\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源状态：原书全文 OCR 未找到“General Adjoint Functor Theorem”的陈述，旧标号 II.5 没有书内依据；本条保留为标准辅助定理，不声称是原书编号定理。证明重构：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，逗号范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C\\downarrow G)\">\\((C\\downarrow G)\\)</span> 局部小且完备；解集给出小弱始集。取其积得弱始对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，再等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 的全部自同态得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\to W\">\\(E\\to W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 弱始，且其每个自同态均为恒等；任意两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\to X\">\\(E\\to X\\)</span> 的等化子利用弱始性推出两箭头相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 始。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的始对象产生泛箭头，唯一性定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的箭头作用并给出伴随。所有乘积/等化所用指标由局部小性落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl[&\\forall J,H\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\ \\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall J,H,L,\\pi\\ (\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(H,J,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal D}(L,\\pi,H)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}(G(L),(G(\\pi_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},G\\circ H))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathcal U\\ \\exists(D_i,u_i)_{i\\in I}\\\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\ (D_i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land u_i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D_i)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,G(D))\\ \\exists i\\in I\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D_i,D)\\ (u=G(h)\\circ u_i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\to\\exists F\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"(C\\downarrow G)","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"E\\to W","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":2458,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem|Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-general-adjoint-functor-theorem|Theorem — General Adjoint Functor Theorem (supplement)]]"}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","55bd5d1a324171ab","d2b4e5cf16585f95","5c5452002ba29fda","dad26c5de724390a"]}